{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The proble- er- story so far...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haryun is the son of the venerated hero Harold which is a bit of a problem since Harold was also the one who taught him the sword. Why would learning the sword from a hero be a problem? Because, he was so <strong>powerful</strong>\u00a0that the kingdom forced him into retirement!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, now he needs to save his childhood friend (from some illness or something; it's probably not too serious anyway). On his journey Haryun will (peacefully?) solve many problems and work together with an incredibly powerful witch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Player plays the game here.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Anti-)Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack:</strong> You can make a super-duper extra over-powered attack which will make you level up and only increase the damage further! (The attack preparations shorten as your level increases.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk:</strong> Let's <strong>pleeease</strong>\u00a0settle this peacefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look:</strong>\u00a0I promise this isn't just a slightly different thing from <strong>Talk</strong>... I mean you use your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgiving difficulty:</strong> Maps reset because they're probably never more than a little damaged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving difficulty:</strong> Attacked the wrong person? Too bad you'll never know. Just give up and ask for some forgiveness (the only forgiving option is to change the difficulty).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More:</strong>\u00a0There's a menu, the game saves, and all kinds of other things you normally find in games!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955870?t=1772404139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955870/481e35fd3eb89abed7bfc46478561886bdbf930a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772404139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955870/deee2a46b2e946f159e4e38ec55e51c869c217fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772404139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955870/deee2a46b2e946f159e4e38ec55e51c869c217fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772404139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4056180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The proble- er- story so far...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haryun is the son of the venerated hero Harold which is a bit of a problem since Harold was also the one who taught him the sword. Why would learning the sword from a hero be a problem? Because, he was so <strong>powerful</strong>\u00a0that the kingdom forced him into retirement!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, now he needs to save his childhood friend (from some illness or something; it's probably not too serious anyway). On his journey Haryun will (peacefully?) solve many problems and work together with an incredibly powerful witch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Player plays the game here.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Anti-)Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class